<title>ESTONIA: HANSA LIISING TO ISSUE 45-DAYS CPS.</title>
<headline>HANSA LIISING TO ISSUE 45-DAYS CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansa Liising, the leasing subsidiary of Hansapank, will issue 40 million kroons in 45-day commercial papers on July 14, Hansapank said on Monday.</p>
<p>The commercial papers will yield 6.3 percent, Hansapank's interest products manager, Ulo Kallas, told Reuters.</p>
<p>Kallas said the 45-day commercial papers are a new product on the market.</p>
<p>Kallas added that Tallinn Water and Sewage company will also issue 40 million kroons in commercial papers on July 8. The three-month papers will yield seven percent.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
